      "value": "@{5c8f538975056470640f1d9f|full_name}: Out of all the things that are unoptimized in vr chat, it would be the player created models and lack of unoptimized with the name tags. If the content is community driven, then why not lead the community in cleaning its stuff up?\n\nAnd about the processor, wasn't it going to be supported with fan cooling? something that the average phone does not have. At most it would allow for a bit more flexibility, not with VR chat sepasicly but with most other games. \n\nLastly, \nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XC36g7rrLgw&t=497s\nLess detal, sure. Faked, not at this point. It would be better to wait this out untill we get the first few reviews of the quest.",
